<Legal title="Privacy Policy" updated="17 November 2026" enPath="/privacy">
  <p>This policy explains what information Convrt collects, how we use it, and the choices you have. Convrt is part of Redstone Technology, based in Doha, Qatar. It covers our website (convrt.qa) and our software platform (app.convrt.qa).</p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>Convrt provides custom software and ongoing software support that helps businesses in Qatar and the Gulf respond to and convert the people who contact them. For privacy questions or requests, email <a href="mailto:privacy@convrt.qa">privacy@convrt.qa</a>. For general support, email <a href="mailto:support@convrt.qa">support@convrt.qa</a>.</p>

  <h2>Information from our website</h2>
  <p>When you fill in the form at convrt.qa/start, we collect what you enter: your name, business name, phone number, Instagram handle (optional), your answers about your business, and your preferred time to be called. We may also record the link you came from (for example, a campaign tag). We use this only to contact you about your request and to understand whether we can help. We do not sell it.</p>

  <h2>Information from businesses that use our platform</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Account details, business information and knowledge-base content the business provides.</li>
    <li>Credentials needed to connect the business's Instagram or Facebook accounts.</li>
    <li>Usage and billing records.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Information from people who message a business that uses our platform</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Platform user ID, display name, username and profile picture link.</li>
    <li>Message content (text, images and voice notes) and timestamps.</li>
    <li>Details shared in the conversation, such as booking requests.</li>
    <li>Summaries and sentiment labels generated to help the business respond.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Please do not send sensitive information such as ID numbers, card details or health information in these conversations.</p>

  <h2>How we use Meta platform data</h2>
  <p>We use data from Instagram and Facebook only to read incoming messages and comments and to send replies on behalf of the connected business. We follow Meta's Platform Terms and Developer Policies. We do not sell this data, share it with data brokers, or use it for advertising.</p>

  <h2>Where data is stored</h2>
  <p>Our primary database and file storage are hosted by Supabase in its Seoul region, so data is processed outside Qatar.</p>

  <h2>Deleting your data</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Email <a href="mailto:privacy@convrt.qa">privacy@convrt.qa</a> with the subject "Data deletion request". If you messaged a business, include the Instagram or Facebook account you used and the business you contacted.</li>
    <li>We confirm receipt within 7 days and complete verified requests within 30 days, free of charge.</li>
    <li>Requests about a conversation with a business are passed to the business that controls that conversation.</li>
    <li>Businesses can disconnect their Meta accounts in the dashboard settings or in their Meta account settings.</li>
    <li>When a business closes its account, its data, including customer conversations, is deleted or anonymised within 90 days, unless the law requires us to keep it longer.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. When we do, we change the date at the top of this page.</p>
</Legal>
